```

---

## 🎨 Design System

```css
BG:      #0B0E14  (deep space)
Text:    #F8FAFC  (soft white, 7:1 contrast)
Glass:   rgba(18,24,38,0.88) + blur(20px)
Indigo:  #6366F1  (primary action)
